{"suttaId":"thag1.97","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[561,564],"vripara":"97"},"segments":{"thag1.97:0.4":"Tissattheragāthā","thag1.97:1.1":"“Hitvā satapalaṃ kaṃsaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ satarājikaṃ;","thag1.97:1.3":"Aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ, idaṃ dutiyābhisecanan”ti.","thag1.97:1.5":"… Tisso thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2437,"to":2437,"paras":[{"para":2437,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.97:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>hitvā</b>ti pariccajitvā.","<b>Satapalan</b>ti sataṃ palāni yassa, taṃ satapalaparimāṇaṃ.","<b>Kaṃsan</b>ti thālaṃ.","<b>Sovaṇṇan</b>ti suvaṇṇamayaṃ.","<b>Satarājikan</b>ti bhittivicittatāya ca anekarūparājicittatāya ca anekalekhāyuttaṃ.","<b>Aggahiṃ mattikāpattan</b>ti evarūpe mahārahe bhājane pubbe bhuñjitvā buddhānaṃ ovādaṃ karonto “idānāhaṃ taṃ chaḍḍetvā mattikāmayapattaṃ aggahesiṃ, aho, sādhu, mayā kataṃ ariyavataṃ anuṭhitan”ti bhājanakittanāpadesena rajjapariccāgaṃ pabbajjūpagamanañca anumodanto vadati.","Tenāha <b>“idaṃ dutiyābhisecanan”</b>ti.","Paṭhamaṃ rajjābhisecanaṃ upādāya idaṃ pabbajjūpagamanaṃ mama dutiyaṃ abhisecanaṃ.","Tañhi rāgādīhi saṃkiliṭṭhaṃ sāsaṅkaṃ saparisaṅkaṃ kammaṃ anatthasañhitaṃ dukkhapaṭibaddhaṃ nihīnaṃ, idaṃ pana taṃvipariyāyato uttamaṃ paṇītanti adhippāyo."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"],["thag1.97:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.97:1.1","hitvā",0,0],["thag1.97:1.1","satapalaṃ",0,1],["thag1.97:1.1","kaṃsaṃ",0,2],["thag1.97:1.1","sovaṇṇaṃ",0,3],["thag1.97:1.1","satarājikaṃ",0,4],["thag1.97:1.3","aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ",0,5],["thag1.97:1.3","idaṃ dutiyābhisecanaṃ",0,6]]},"tika":null}
